## **P**: Performance {#performance}

. . .

**What we report**

| Measure | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Bias** | Accuracy (closeness to truth) |
| **SE / MSE** | Precision / total deviation |
| **Coverage** | Interval reliability |
| **Type I / Power** | Test validity |
| **MCSE** | Simulation uncertainty |

. . .

